# The right branch of Olmedo et al., TOPLAS 2018, Example 4.9 (p. 4:20): two fair coins (0 is
# heads), observing at least one head; the r2 value of [y = 0] is 2/3.
# Expected: not valid (the bound is false).
nat x;
nat y;
{
	x := 0;
}[1/2]{
	x := 1;
}
{
	y := 0;
}[1/2]{
	y := 1;
}
observe(x = 0 || y = 0);
?Ex [[y = 0]] >= 0.7 r2
